{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Transportation to make an investigation and study of a certain current Senate document relative to mobility pricing.","BillNumber":"S2625","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J27","Name":"Joint Committee on Transportation","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27","ResponseDate":"2024-02-05T19:34:27.613"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2625/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, February 8, 2024 -- The committee on Transportation, to whom was referred the petition (accompanied by resolve, Senate, No. 2214) of Brendan P. Crighton and Steven Owens that provisions be made for an investigation and study by a special commission on the development and deployment of comprehensive and regionally-equitable public transportation, roadway and congestion pricing, report the accompanying Order  (Senate, No. 2625).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Transportation be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of a certain current Senate document numbered 2214 relative to mobility pricing.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}